<title>USA: Mitchell Energy to post gain on unit sales.</title>
<headline>Mitchell Energy to post gain on unit sales.</headline>
<dateline>THE WOODLANDS, Texas 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitchell Energy &amp; Development Corp said on Thursday that it will post a small gain from the sale of 21,000 acres of timberlands and a 51 percent interest in its Mitchell Mortgage division.</p>
<p>Senior public relations representative Bill Ainsworth said the company has not yet computed the amount of the gain, but described it as small.</p>
<p>Pre-tax cash proceeds from the sales totaled $47 million and the company has plans to sell an additional $20 million of assets, Mitchell said.  The timberlands sales were in three separate transactions, the company said.</p>
